---

This repository has been created exclusively for the Master’s thesis defense and academic evaluation at Shahid Beheshti University, Tehran.  
It contains research-related code, experimental scripts, trained models, configuration files, visual outputs, and analytical reports produced during the preparation of the above thesis.

The repository serves as a **temporary academic archive** prepared solely for the thesis supervisor, examiners, and the academic committee of Shahid Beheshti University.  
Its purpose is to provide transparent access to the depth, methodology, and technical implementation of the conducted research.

All materials in this repository — including source code, trained weights, datasets, figures, and documents — are the **intellectual property of the author**.  
These materials **may not be copied, distributed, reproduced, or used**, whether in part or in full, for any academic, commercial, or derivative purpose without explicit written permission from the author.

Although this repository contributes to the open scientific community, it is **not an open-source project**.  
The contents are shared **solely for academic review and defense purposes** during the Master’s thesis evaluation at Shahid Beheshti University.

